 (name "ST7789 SPI Display 6-Pin")
 (description "240x320 (or 240x240) ST7789 IPS TFT, 4-wire SPI, 3.3-5 V supply, ~80 mA.\nRES and BLK are pulled up on the module (no hardware reset, backlight always on).\nSCL = SPI clock, SDA = SPI MOSI (write-only), DC = data/command, CS = chip select (active low).")
 (keywords "display,lcd,tft,st7789,ips,spi,240x320")
